            "role": "agent",
            "speaker_id": "speaker_en_au_female_1",
            "gender": "female",
            "text": "Once approved, you'll receive a grant agreement that you'll need to sign and return, and then you've got twelve months to complete the irrigation upgrade and submit your final plan."
